Test rg07: operators (all operators in precedence order)
100/
    law 1|2         // bitwise OR: 3
    law 1^3         // bitwise XOR: 2
    law 7&5         // bitwise AND: 5
    law 1<<3        // left shift: 10
    law 10>>2       // right shift: 2
    law 3+4         // add: 7
    law 5-2         // subtract: 3
    law 3*4         // multiply: 14 (octal)
    law 10/3        // divide: 2 (octal 10 = decimal 8, 8/3=2)
    law 7%%3        // modulo: 1
    ~1              // bitwise complement: 777776 (standalone, same as math.am1)
    -3              // unary minus: 777774 (standalone; law takes 12-bit positive only)
    law (1+2)*3     // parenthesized expression: 11 (octal)
stop
